WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
If you're on a split dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.080
Confirm with your written instructions.

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.240
Split dosing means you take the first half of your prep the evening before

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.690
and the second half the morning of your procedure, typically six hours before

5
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.560
your arrival time.

6
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.880
When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second dose as directed on your

7
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:19.920
prep instructions.

8
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.230
Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the cutoff time we've

9
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:23.920
specified.

10
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.600
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That's how we know

11
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.480
your prep is working.

12
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.200
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first

13
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.040
thing in the morning.

14
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.080
You're almost done.
